# Stack Test
# Einsteinium (Es) — real density 8.84 g/cm³. three cubes stacked — simulate: collapse checks the load path.
scene "Einsteinium Stack Test"

bottom = cube 20mm color: #40ff10 at (0, 10mm, 0)
middle = cube 20mm color: #40ff10 at (0, 30mm, 0)
top = cube 20mm color: #40ff10 at (0, 50mm, 0)
